        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>SOSS 216 Invisible Door Hinges</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSOSS 216 hinges are for use on <b>1-3/8\" thick wood doors</b>. Package includes one (1) hinge with matching finish  #14 x 1-1/2\" wood screws. When the door is closed, SOSS Invisible Hinges cannot be seen or tampered with. When opened, the riveted hinge pin is non-removable. The installed hinge is firmly anchored in a deep, full mortise, which assists the screws in supporting the door, assuring a stronger door hinge installation.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<center>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN-Finish-9.jpg?v=1704354519\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\" alt=\"SOSS 216 Hinge Specifications\">\r\n</center>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available for <a href=\"/products/1-inch-thick-door-invisible-door-hinges-soss-208\"><b>1\" thick doors SOSS 208 Hinge</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/invisible-door-hinge-for-1-3-4-inch-thick-doors-soss-218\"><b>1-3/4\" thick doors SOSS 218 Hinge</b></a>, and <a href=\"/products/2-inch-thick-door-invisible-door-hinge-soss-220\"><b>2\" thick doors SOSS 220 Hinge</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the SOSS 216 Concealed Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Height: 4-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Leaf Plate Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Width: 2-23/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Minimum 1-3/8\" Thick Door</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #14 x 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: High Strength Steel</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/216.pdf?v=1704262260\" target=\"new\"><b>SOSS 216 Hinge Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually (1 Door Hinge)</b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "1-3/8 Thick Door Invisible Door Hinge, SOSS 216",
                "description": "SOSS 216 hinges are for use on 1-3/8 inch thick wood  doors. Package includes one (1) hinge with  matching finish  #14 x 1-1/2 inch wood screws. When the door is closed, SOSS Invisible Hinges cannot be seen or tampered with. When opened, the riveted hinge pin is non-removable. The installed hinge is firmly anchored in a deep, full mortise, which assists the screws in supporting the door, assuring a stronger door hinge installation.",
